{"title":"Florida mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Florida_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Florida middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Florida_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Florida high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Florida_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">Florida middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Florida_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Florida middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=298\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Florida_MathCounts\" title=\"Florida MathCounts\">Florida MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Florida_Association_of_Mu_Alpha_Theta\" title=\"Florida Association of Mu Alpha Theta\">Florida Association of Mu Alpha Theta</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://famat.org/\">website</a> (affiliate of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mu_Alpha_Theta\" title=\"Mu Alpha Theta\">Mu Alpha Theta</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stetson_Invitational_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Stetson Invitational Mathematics Contest (page does not exist)\">Stetson Invitational Mathematics Contest</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Florida_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Florida high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Florida_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Florida high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=214\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Barry_University_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Barry University Math Contest (page does not exist)\">Barry University Math Contest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=David_Essner_Mathematics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"David Essner Mathematics Competition (page does not exist)\">David Essner Mathematics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math.miami.edu/~paulmcd/worksheet.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FAU_Math_Competition\" title=\"FAU Math Competition\">FAU Math Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math.fau.edu/mathday/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FGCU_Invitational_Mathematics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"FGCU Invitational Mathematics Competition (page does not exist)\">FGCU Invitational Mathematics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.fgcu.edu/events/mathcompetition/index.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Florida-Stuyvesant_Alumni_Mathematics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Florida-Stuyvesant Alumni Mathematics Competition (page does not exist)\">Florida-Stuyvesant Alumni Mathematics Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mu_Alpha_Theta_Math_Competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mu Alpha Theta Math Competitions (page does not exist)\">Mu Alpha Theta Math Competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Palm_Harbor_University_High_School_Invitational&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Palm Harbor University High School Invitational (page does not exist)\">Palm Harbor University High School Invitational</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=SFAASHS_Internet_Math_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"SFAASHS Internet Math Competition (page does not exist)\">SFAASHS Internet Math Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stetson_Invitational_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Stetson Invitational Mathematics Contest (page does not exist)\">Stetson Invitational Mathematics Contest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Timberwolf_Invitational_at_Lawton_Chiles_High_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Timberwolf Invitational at Lawton Chiles High School (page does not exist)\">Timberwolf Invitational at Lawton Chiles High School</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Florida_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Florida_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018084728\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 31/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1399:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018084728 and revision id 184350. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}